  "passSource034": "Compares the selected Odakyu departure-station pass price with the adult IC round-trip fare to Fujisawa and fares for entered journeys within the Enoden/Odakyu free area.",
  "passSource035": "Compares the adult one-day pass (¥600) and 24-hour pass (¥700). Fares are based on IC/contactless payment, including eligible same-card transfers within 30 minutes at designated stops. Derived station, line and fare-rule data follows Wikipedia contributors’ CC BY-SA 4.0 terms; official PDF originals are not bundled. Cash, bus and child fares are excluded.",
  "passSource036": "Looks up adult two- and three-day pass prices from 70 Odakyu departure stations. Mountain railway, cable car, ropeway and sightseeing cruise fares are exact; bus totals are estimates using each operator’s average fare and entered ride counts.",
  "passSource037": "Compares the adult subway one-day pass (¥830) with the Donichika Ticket (¥520). Donichika is valid only on Saturdays, Sundays, public holidays and December 29–January 3. Fare bands were checked against Sapporo City open data (CC BY 4.0) and official guidance. Derived station-order and adjacent-distance data follows Wikipedia contributors’ CC BY-SA 4.0 terms. Transfers to other operators, discounts and child fares are excluded.",
  "passSource038": "Timetable-based fastest routes, attraction benefits, excluded buses, limited-express and seat charges are excluded. Some Keihan operating-distance data follows Wikipedia contributors’ CC BY-SA 4.0 terms.",
