  "passSource050": "Derived station, fare and stop-order data retains CC BY-SA 4.0 terms and original attribution. Limited-express options are available only for verified station pairs served by regular trains. Bus amounts are estimates, not exact fares. Green Cars and sightseeing, seasonal and steam trains are excluded.",
